# [PACKAGE DOC]
# Top-level Python package for XLA (xla/python). The file itself is empty: it only marks the
# directory as an importable package and defines no names, performs no registrations and has no
# import-time side effects. Users import submodules directly, for example the client wrapper module
# (xla_client) that re-exports the compiled extension and the tests that live next to it.
